Easier said than done. When you're engaged in the task of solidly
defining what was formerly not solidly defined, what counts as a
change? It's partly in the eye of the beholder. That's why I think
the BF needs a good spectrum of beholders -- to make sure that the
degree of change is acceptable to the eye of the average Lojbanist.

